  {
   "n": 9,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>\n\tConsider the following grammar:</p>\n<p>\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"media/a1/a1d25ee800afa9b7f5c7.png\" /></p>\n<p>\n\tWhere S and X are non-terminals and a, b are terminals. Which of the following can be the viable prefixes?</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "baab"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "aab"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "aaabab"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "bbbaX"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "A"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "A",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>\n\t(b)<br />\n\tViable prefixes: Combination of non-terminal and terminal which can be in the stack during parsing is called viable prefix.<br />\n\tA handle X&rarr; b is available. So whenever terminal b is encounter it is popped out before inserting new element into the stack.<br />\n\tOption (a) is wrong because before popping &lsquo;b&rsquo; element &lsquo;aab&rsquo; is inserted.<br />\n\tOption (b) is correct after &lsquo;b&rsquo; no element has inserted.<br />\n\tSo, option (c) and (d) also incorrect.</p>"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>\n\tConsider the following statements:<br />\n\t(i) Type checking is done during all the phases especially in syntax analysis phase.<br />\n\t(ii) Target code generation phase is machine independent code generation.<br />\n\t(iii) SDT with only synthesized attribute, always have a order of evaluation.<br />\n\t(iv) Symbol table is constructed during analysis part of compiler<br />\n\tWhich of the above is correct?</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "(i) and (ii) only"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "(iii) and (iv) only"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "(ii) and (iv)"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "(i) and (ii) only"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "B"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "B",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 2,
    "neg": 0.66
   },
   "solution": "<p>\n\t(b)<br />\n\t&bull; Type checking is done during semantic analysis phase.<br />\n\t&bull; Target code generation is machine specific.<br />\n\t&bull; SDT with only synthesized attribute does not have any cyclic dependency. So always have order of evaluation.<br />\n\t&bull; Symbol table is constructed during the lexical, syntax and semantic analysis phase.</p>"
  },
