  {
   "n": 13,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>\n\tWhich of the following is not a token in C language?</p>",
   "options": [
