   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "D",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>\n\t(d)<br />\n\tC tokens are:<br />\n\t1. Keywords<br />\n\t2. Identifiers<br />\n\t3. Constants<br />\n\t4. Symbols ( ;, (, ), }, {, etc.)<br />\n\t5. Operators<br />\n\tWhite spaces are used to separate the tokens but they are not counted as a token. White spaces are ignored while identifying the tokens.</p>"
